  "description": "Primera – The Classic Steel Road Tandem Built for Performance and Durability\nThe Primera is a classic steel road tandem that sets the benchmark for performance, value, and durability. Whether you're tackling club rides, embarking on self-contained touring, or just enjoying a long-distance ride, the Primera Tandem is engineered to deliver a smooth, steady ride across all terrains. Its Co-Motion craftsmanship and proven geometry make it a perfect blend of comfort and performance, designed to withstand the test of time.\nKey Features:\n\nOptimized for 700c wheels with 28-35mm tires for a fast, smooth ride\n\nCo-Motion zonally-butted chromoly tubing for strength, lightness, and comfort\n\nOversized 44mm head tube & unicrown touring fork for precision handling\n\nProven Co-Motion touring geometry designed for long-distance stability\n\nRack & fender mounts for added versatility on tours and commutes\n\nDual disc brakes for reliable stopping power in all conditions\n\nShimano 105 drivetrain for smooth, efficient shifting\n\nHand-built touring wheels for durability and consistent performance\n\nDesigned for riders who demand a reliable, high-performance tandem, the Primera offers the best in steel construction, smooth handling, and versatile touring capability. Whether you're cruising with friends or going on a grand adventure, the Primera Tandem is ready for whatever the road brings.\n\nComplete bike starting at $5,195.00\nConfigure custom features and price options below\n\nClick here to get your Co-Motion Primera order started!",
